Article 2 (Scope of Application) The schools subject to these Rules shall be as follows: <Amended on Jan. 10, 2000; Jun. 1, 2011>
1. The Korea National Defense University under the Korea National Defense University Establishment Act;
2. The Army, Naval, and Air Force Academies under the Military Academy Establishment Act;
3. The Armed Forces Nursing Academy under the Armed Forces Nursing Academy Establishment Act;
4. The Korea Army Academy at Yeongcheon under the Korea Army Academy at Yeongcheon Establishment Act;
5. The Air Force Aviation Science High School under the Air Force Aviation Science High School Establishment Act.
